{EVOLVINGFAMILIAR2FAMILIARATTACK}%攻击力，{EVOLVINGFAMILIAR2FAMILIARHEALTHPERCENT}%生命值。

鲜花超级恶魔：
{EVOLVINGFAMILIAR3FAMILIARATTACK}%攻击力，{EVOLVINGFAMILIAR3FAMILIARHEALTHPERCENT}%生命值。
